{"ID":"20240506105102-bmdtjt9","Spec":"1","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"custom-sy-readonly":"false","id":"20240506105102-bmdtjt9","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240506105102-bmdtjt9\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240702112924-d41rtrr\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240613130413-nkxm72f\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240702113523-xxp14xp\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:4,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:4\u0026#125;","title":"315皂荚（皂角）","type":"doc","updated":"20240902124437"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240902115935-sc1nd23","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902115935-sc1nd23","updated":"20240902115935"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"皂角（大皂荚）"}]},{"ID":"20240702112924-d41rtrr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240702112924-d41rtrr","updated":"20240718100414"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 440px;","style":"width: 430px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"皂荚3"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/皂荚3-20240702112924-zv4qs6r.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 430px;\" parent-style=\"width: 440px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240718100321-zdd303u","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240718100321-zdd303u","updated":"20240826143418"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 602px;","style":"width: 592px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"皂角"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/皂角-20240718095809-fe8tuh4.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 592px;\" parent-style=\"width: 602px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 603px;","style":"width: 593px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"皂荚"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/皂荚-20240826143418-ci0l1xi.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 593px;\" parent-style=\"width: 603px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240902115859-dtgylwl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902115859-dtgylwl","updated":"20240902115859"}},{"ID":"20240902115856-txfq2ae","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902115856-txfq2ae","updated":"20240902115856"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"猪牙皂角（小皂荚）"}]},{"ID":"20240902115856-s4xu1it","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902115856-s4xu1it","updated":"20240902115856"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【产地】\t主产山东、云南、贵州、四川等地。\n【性状】\t干燥荚果呈圆柱形，略扁，弯曲作镰形，长510cm，宽512mm。表面紫棕色或紫黑色，被灰白色粉霜，擦去后有光泽，并有细小的疣状突起及线状裂纹，腹缝线突起呈棱脊状，背缝线突起不显著而有棕黄色纵纹。先端有喙状的花柱残基，基部有果柄残痕。质硬而脆，易折断，断面外层棕黄色，中间黄白色，中心较软，有淡绿或淡棕黄色的丝状物与斜向网纹，纵向剖开可见排列整齐的凹窝，很少见种子。臭微，有刺激性，嗅其粉末则作喷嚏，味先甜后辣。\n【性味】\t辛、咸，温，有小毒。\n【功效】\t通窍，涤痰，搜风，杀虫。治中风口噤，头风，风痼，喉痹，痰喘，痞满积滞，关格不通，痈肿，疥癞，癣疾，头疮。"}]},{"ID":"20240902115856-1ajb9sh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902115856-1ajb9sh","updated":"20240902115856"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240206104101-qp00tjd.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240902115856-eu7cq3e","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902115856-eu7cq3e","updated":"20240902115856"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"皂角"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/皂角-20240205164055-coy2rlb.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240902115846-paae3fd","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240902115846-paae3fd"}},{"ID":"20240702112744-koxhtlr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240702112744-koxhtlr","updated":"20240826143431"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 364px;","style":"width: 354px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"皂荚1"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/皂荚1-20240702112744-ra56dmj.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 354px;\" parent-style=\"width: 364px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240826144257-fir6fpc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240826144257-fir6fpc","updated":"20240826144257"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 478px;","style":"width: 468px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"皂荚 (4)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/皂荚 4-20240826144202-5ms4a5n.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 468px;\" parent-style=\"width: 478px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 813px;","style":"width: 803px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Ty